1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''New York, New York, U.S., Marriage License Indexes,''' 1907-2018 
2 CONT Name	Hildur S Lindstrom
2 CONT Gender	Female
2 CONT Marriage License Date	1953
2 CONT Marriage License Place	Brooklyn, New York City, New York, USA
2 CONT Spouse	John G Shatinsky
2 CONT License Number	3746
2 CONT
2 CONT Named in the obituary of husband https://www.geni.com/people/John-Shatinsky/6000000226472559850?through=6000000033400118817
2 CONT
2 CONT '''GRAVE''' https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/49312652/hildur-shatinsky
2 CONT
2 CONT '''OBITUARY Mrs Hildur Sigrid Shatinsky, 79''' - Capital, The (Annapolis, MD) - Thursday, March 2, 2000
2 CONT Hildur Sigrid Shatinsky, 79, a longtime resident of Arnold and formerly of Norfolk, Va., died Feb. 26 at Future Care-Chesapeake in Arnold after a long illness.
2 CONT Mrs. Shatinsky was born and raised in Brooklyn, N.Y. and was educated in New York City public schools. During World War II, she served as a WAVE in the Navy. She was chosen as the WAVE model for a 1952 U.S. postage stamp that hono
2 CONC red "Women in the Armed Services."
2 CONT She retired from the Electromagnetic Compatability Analysis Center in Annapolis.
2 CONT Mrs. Shatinsky was a volunteer at the Naval Hospital in Annapolis and a member of the local Quilt Club and Waves Club. She won numerous awards on her counted cross stitch pieces at Londontowne and Sotterley Plantation. She was als
2 CONC o an avid flower gardener.
2 CONT ''Her husband of 19 years, John George Shatinsky, died in 1972.''
2 CONT Survivors include two daughters, of Clinton and of Halethorpe; two sisters, Evelyn Davis of Jacksonville, Fla., and Judy Pearson of Brooklyn, N.Y.; and four grandsons.
2 CONT Friends may meet from 8 to 8:30 a.m. Tuesday at Barranco and Sons Severna Park Funeral Home, 495 Ritchie Highway, and then proceed to Arlington National Cemetery in Virginia for a graveside service at 11 a.m.
2 CONT In lieu of flowers, donations may be made to the Alzheimer's Association, 1850 York Road, Suite D, Timonium, MD 21093-5142.
2 CONT Capital, The (Annapolis, MD) - Thursday, March 2, 2000; Capital, The (Annapolis, Maryland) 2 March 2000, obit for Hildur Shatinsky, GenealogyBank.com (https://www.genealogybank.com/doc/obituaries/obit/14A342B6C19EB410-14A342B6C19E
2 CONC B410 : accessed 6 July 2026)
